WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
On a wide monitor, your clock is way over there.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Fuginaut puts a second one right where you look.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
One click, it's off.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.500
One click, it's back.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Keep a second time zone beside your own.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Search for it by city or by UTC offset.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.500
27 languages.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.000
12 calendars.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.500
17 number systems.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.500
One moment, written seven ways.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Then make it yours.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Fonts, colors, emoji, and date formats.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Every change shows live as you make it.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Fuginaut.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Free and open source for the Mac.
